linhas.en:
Make a girl feel gladness; hatred;
joy; fear―――Whatever pleases her
will suffice.

You're #C000246204in the Far Side of the Moon#CDEF,
where #C236196003BB#CDEF was born;
where the #C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF were born―――

You'll most likely end up fighting. Prepare as
if it will always turn into a fight, and please,
don't show them any mercy.

This is Heaven's battlefield;
a garden of selfishness where wishes
are put on the line.

In this greatly anachronistic, wooden space
was a boy in a black uniform;
a young man dressed in a coat;
and a young man donned in white armor.

I wouldn't have suggested if it were not
for these circumstances,
Mister #RUBS     arahan #RUBEenlightened#REND monk.

Trapping us in the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF,
using that strange Servant #C236196003Lancer#CDEF,
and having that much power?

I thought you were a spoiled, rich kid;
an elitism fanatic; a horrible prick at
heart, but…

That culprit who imprisoned us all here;
That AI who destroyed the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF―――
Is #C236196003BB#CDEF.

Out of selfish desire you snatched riches;
without reason snatched lives: a repulsive
murderer. Your thinking is far too distinct.

#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF is a cold-blooded Heroic Spirit;
a self-serving usurper;
a tyrant who, under the title of "king" reaped many lives.

The same thought hangs over all of us;
we're each afraid of what our "forgotten" memories
will be like.

#C080080080Once I focus my awareness and pick from the
bottom of my thoughts, I see one, and then another;
THEIR visages, the ones I had overcome, return to me.#CDEF

#C236196003Shinji#CDEF's death.
Our final battle against #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF;
the second showdown with #C236196003BB#CDEF that awaits us afterwards.
